mut_recon (perf/mut-recon-kernels) — the `&mut [u8]` recon-kernel refactor, 2026-08-09
=====================================================================================

Host        Apple M4 Pro, 12 cores (8P+4E), macOS 26.5.2, idle
Base        main @ cebb97f
Branch      perf/mut-recon-kernels
dav1d       1.5.4 (homebrew), --framedelay 1, same interleaved sweep
Build       cargo build --release, DEFAULT features, no -C target-cpu=native
Arms        base    = main, clean build
            head    = branch, band armed
            headoff = THE SAME BINARY as head with RAV1D_OWNED_RECON=0
Harness     scripts/perf/verify_gap.sh, 9 rounds, two-point wall fit at 2 and 20
            frames, rotating arm order, strict idle gate (foreign_max = 0 on all
            288 rows), 1 cell-round discarded and re-run. No `nice` on timed runs.

