INVALIDATED RUN
  An earlier 288-row sweep (n=9, same protocol) is NOT in this directory: its
  staged `bench_head` was a `--features probe-sites` build, because cargo writes
  both feature sets to target/release/examples/bench_ab_decode. `sample` put
  site_probe::record at 51.4% of leaf samples; /usr/bin/time -l showed 45.5 s
  user against base's 10.0 s. Check `strings <binary> | grep site_probe` before
  staging an arm.
